# Internal working docs. NEVER published — docs/ is the Pages source, so anything
# reachable there can end up on archflowai.dev.
#
# Ignored by DEFAULT so a new working doc is safe without anyone remembering a
# list. The three exceptions below are design records that were already public
# and are worth keeping in the repo; they are still excluded from the site build
# by docs/_config.yml.
docs/internal/*
!docs/internal/archflow-releases-v2-proposal.md
!docs/internal/archflow-skill-scaffolding-proposal.md
!docs/internal/landing-page-plan.md

# npm package build output (archflow, and the archflowai alias)
/node_modules/
/archflow-*.tgz
packages/*/node_modules/
packages/*/package-lock.json
packages/*/*.tgz
